{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Utils.Embedded</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"gillian","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Gillian","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Utils","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Embedded","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Extraction of files embedded in the binary</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-mkdir_p\"><a href=\"#val-mkdir_p\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> mkdir_p : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-write_files\"><a href=\"#val-write_files\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> write_files : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>(string * string)</span> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-cache_root\"><a href=\"#val-cache_root\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> cache_root : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fresh_dir\"><a href=\"#val-fresh_dir\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fresh_dir : <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>(string * string)</span> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-dir\"><a href=\"#val-dir\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> dir : <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>(string * string)</span> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>dir ~name files</code> returns a directory that contains <code>files</code> (relative path, contents). The directory is created on first use, in the user's cache directory, under a name that depends on the contents.</p></div></div>"}